<section class="shipping-policy-section section-padding">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <div class="shipping-header text-center">
      <span class="text-eyebrow">Customer Care &amp; Logistics</span>
      <h1 class="h2">Shipping, Delivery &amp; Exchanges</h1>
      <p class="text-body">Order dispatch, Cash on Delivery, and exchanges for ADOT Official — Pakistan only.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="shipping-content-cards">
      <div class="shipping-card">
        <h2 class="h4">Nationwide delivery</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Where we deliver:</strong> All over Pakistan. We do not ship outside Pakistan right now.</li>
          <li><strong>Processing:</strong> 1–2 working days after your order is confirmed.</li>
          <li><strong>Delivery time:</strong> Big cities (Karachi, Lahore, Islamabad, Rawalpindi, Faisalabad, and similar): <strong>3–5 working days</strong>. Other cities and towns: <strong>5–7 working days</strong>. Far or remote areas: up to <strong>10 working days</strong>.</li>
          <li><strong>Working days:</strong> Monday to Saturday. Public holidays are not counted. Times are estimates — sales, weather, strikes, or courier delays can add time.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="shipping-card">
        <h2 class="h4">Delivery cost</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>PKR 250</strong> flat for orders under PKR 5,000.</li>
          <li><strong>Free delivery</strong> on orders of <strong>PKR 5,000 and above</strong>.</li>
          <li>You see the exact amount at checkout before you pay.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="shipping-card">
        <h2 class="h4">Cash on Delivery (COD)</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Pay cash to the rider when your parcel arrives. Keep the exact amount ready.</li>
          <li><strong>No extra COD fee.</strong></li>
          <li>We may call or WhatsApp you to confirm. If we cannot reach you within 48 hours, we may cancel the order.</li>
          <li>Please give a full correct address and a phone number that works. The courier usually calls before delivery.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="shipping-card">
        <h2 class="h4">7-day exchange</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Ask for a size or colour exchange within <strong>7 days</strong> of delivery. Item must be unworn, unwashed, with tags and original packing.</li>
          <li>One exchange per order, and only if we have stock. For size or change-of-mind exchanges, you pay the return courier; we pay to send the new item.</li>
          <li><strong>Wrong, damaged, or faulty:</strong> WhatsApp us within <strong>48 hours</strong> with photos (unboxing video helps). We send a free replacement or full refund — we pay the courier.</li>
          <li>Sale items: size exchange only (if in stock). No refund on sale items except wrong/damaged/faulty.</li>
          <li>Full rules: <a href="/policies/refund-policy">Refund and Exchange Policy</a> and <a href="/policies/shipping-policy">Shipping Policy</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="shipping-card">
        <h2 class="h4">Contact</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/923706735800" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">+92 370 6735800</a></li>
          <li>Email: <a href="mailto:support@adotoffical.com">support@adotoffical.com</a></li>
          <li>Support hours: Mon–Sat, 9:00am–5:00pm (Pakistan Time)</li>
          <li>If the outer packing is badly torn when it arrives, take a photo before you accept it and message us right away.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="shipping-card__updated text-micro">Last updated: October 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .shipping-policy-section {
    padding: 60px 20px;
    background-color: var(--color-background, #fff);
  }
  .shipping-header {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .shipping-header h1 {
    margin: 8px 0 12px;
  }
  .shipping-content-cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .shipping-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e5e5);
    border-radius: 0;
    padding: 24px 28px;
    background: var(--color-surface, #fafafa);
  }
  .shipping-card h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }
  .shipping-card ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }
  .shipping-card li {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text, #333);
  }
  .shipping-card a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.15em;
  }
  .shipping-card__updated {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-subtle, #737373);
  }
</style>

